{"reviewId": "13294121_89U0K9kGj", "review": {"abstract": "康波从萧条向回升的转换本质上就是从滞胀向通缩的转换，此时经济增速不断下降，商品价格明显回落，通缩成为社会的共识，这个过程也有10年之久。", "atUserVids": [], "bookId": "3300128305", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "chapterName": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "chapterUid": 6, "content": "2026年6月，CPI连续第四年低于102（即增长率低于2%的健康通胀），勉强维持在100以上。PPI连续第三年低于100。人口自然增长率连续十年下滑，出生率降低，死亡率上升。萧条初现，AI或许是曙光，但距离形成真正的生产力带来回升还比较遥远，谷底还未到达。", "contextAbstract": "", "friendship": 0, "htmlContent": "", "isPrivate": 0, "notVisibleToFriends": 0, "range": "4712-4780", "createTime": 1781596871, "title": "", "type": 1, "chapterIdx": 6, "reviewId": "13294121_89U0K9kGj", "userVid": 13294121, "topics": [], "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "author": {"userVid": 13294121, "name": "夏然", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/PiajxSqBRaEIeMI778aXNaPMkgDBdmvWRXYyu1E4FN1IwQuK4rVkNMcUNbQR2vUiah5cF6APuvUo1xGiaP5HLGcOg/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M3-0-200", "desc": "阅读天数", "title": "阅读天数", "levelIndex": 200}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 21, "likes": [{"userVid": 901931368, "name": "🤫", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/PiajxSqBRaEIseI6KbU7d70vL9GCS3mMdGktVuk27AX2LLtFiaOQNPmZueEicPUtKwoSgTjoryoG4lrRvyA2vG9XDwAO2JpzVibPZJ8YoGXHHW4pDtd7h8WFdw/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": ""}], "commentsCount": 1, "hotComments": [], "comments": [{"content":